OL,3,GNEWSANew market hall welcomed despite
OL,4,Aparking fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and shoppers in Stafford
OL,7,Fhave welcomed plans to transform the
OL,8,Fformer Guildhall Shopping Centre into a
OL,9,Fnew market hall, although some have
OL,10,Fraised concerns about a lack of town
OL,11,Fcentre parking.
OL,13,FThe redevelopment will see the site
OL,14,Fconverted into a venue housing 28
OL,15,Findependent businesses, including
OL,16,Fshops, food stalls, cafes and bars,
OL,17,Falongside space for events and live
OL,18,Fperformances.
OL,20,FThe project has been backed by #10m of
OL,21,Fgovernment funding secured following a
OL,22,Fcampaign by Stafford MP Leigh Ingham.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
